Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running, forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is calling out, so ride the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as one,\Nso let's sail in the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.64,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our hearts have\Ntraveled different paths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We are best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our freedom is our only compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pointing us along the\Nmany roads that come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We will keep on running forward every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go east, go west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep looking to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see everything all crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all so thrilled that we\Ncan't wait until the dawn arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll just bring the\Nsun ourselves to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If the winds blow, we're waiting\Nwhere we should be going, go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, we're\Nshining. Running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All of our dreams will\Nmerge into one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where we go,\Nwe'll be fine and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause all our treasure is our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're shining, running forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is coming out, so ride away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all together as well, so\Nlet's just stay with us, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our dreams are never-ending, so\Nlet's wake up, wake up, wake up, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat, we will be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My darkness will swallow the\Nworld, just you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'll lose to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.86,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's treasure belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll ride non-stop and travel farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,than we've ever gone And then tomorrow we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,will find suspense And then commence to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:02:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live out another day so intense.\NThat's right, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Running forever. Let's go along\Nwith curiosity. Our feelings lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.32,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the way straight to a brand new day Into\Nanother adventure Come on, we're shining,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,running forever Open the map inside your\Nheart and see No matter where we end up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,our mods will never give up There's a fire\Nin our dreams And you can never, never,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,never, never stop it We\Nwill be one, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My face is so sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about art, but scams\Nare not supposed to look like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.08,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so tacky!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to compliment my figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.96,0:02:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get away from me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one kind of artist I can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an escape artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here or I'll make you\Ninto stiff figures this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.48,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you can do anything\Nto us if you can't even reach us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If she keeps using that\Nweird power of hers,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sunny could end up\Nas a finger painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,or something else ugly and useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Franky will\Nbe furious either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that we can fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, the best we can do is try to\Nstop her from screwing it up even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to keep our\Nattention out here, away from the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's time to bring it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just sit there, you buffoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something before they get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring me Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right away, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul is being bombarded by such\Nmarvelous artistic teachers today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, she's doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, aim this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the ones you want, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Another vision of freedom and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's all express\Nourselves, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll ruin the sun for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.16,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny, it's all messed up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, uncultured swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The young master has instructed me to\Nkidnap Momonosuke and commandeer your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And without your vessel,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you Straw Hats will have to be very creative\Nto find another way out of Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You need treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is to manage the injuries of\Nall the competitors, especially guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let people kill each\Nother for an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you care if I get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head's bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your helmet off so I can take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them treat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your injuries are too serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't walk on my own. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the stairs down to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is competing\Nas we speak, Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After the match is fine, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So Joker is ordering me\Nto murder Straw Hat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphy's a generous leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you lost the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he's giving you one more\Nchance to redeem yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy your task is so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.82,0:07:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure he's taken care of\Nbefore the competition ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pegging in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You do want to become an executive\Nof the family, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Cavendish, I heard you was\Ntrying to off that Lucy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartolomeo, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done making it this far, but my\Nbusiness with Lucy doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy ain't yours to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He is hogging the limelight,\Nbut no one else can touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say he and I have a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The contestants are dropping like flies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle of Bloxie\Nis getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear to be anybody's\Ngame now, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You may notice that we have one competitor\Nwho literally stands out from the crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Blox!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This warrior is part of a new generation\Nfrom Elbath, the giant country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up for Pirudin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.86,0:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this a fair match-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.16,0:08:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm unstoppable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait till I get my hands on that\NFlame Fruit. With that power, I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,king of the giants one punch and it's over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,just like clockwork at\Nthis rate no one will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,be able to meet this\Nguy well actually maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,i should take that back we got our out of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,control ball running\Nloose in the arena unfazed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,by these tough contenders this wild beast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,wants killed Twenty-one\Ndeath row prisoners
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,during the previous battle\Nin this very Corsia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A Grim Reaper through and through,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,let's hear it for our favorite\Nrampaging beast, Ruta Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet despite his savagery, one of our\Ncontestants seems to have befriended him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a mysterious newcomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but his strength and talent makes\Nhim an instant crowd favorite, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that guy go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you have to be impartial.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Run him over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,People love him without\Neven knowing who he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you really gonna fight that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a big mistake.\NCrap! Lucy, run! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aunt Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a tragedy, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a mismatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The rookie from Elbam is victorious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them in one swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a terrible way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy just fell. The giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was incredible, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart's beating out of my chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,With fighters like this, can you blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A single contender is turning\Nthis competition on its head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when you think it's\Nover, Lucy has done it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lucy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.66,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is this mysterious\NLuffy, and where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.70,0:12:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a real mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined he was this strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still inside the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do it someplace else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyrule and Ghost flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is some kind of explosion to blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, that wasn't an explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not forget, even without\NHirudan, Bloxie's loaded with power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:14:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That powder keg punch was generated by a\Nman with some distinctly shaped shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Edeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who rocked the giant right\Nout of the ring was none other than
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the two-time champion of the new\NWorld Central Fighting Tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruction Cannon Edeo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, that's not the only\Nfight you want to keep an eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Trio of gangsters hailing from\Nthe Kano Kingdom in the Far East,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,each with a truly unique fighting style.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's their patented Isokan\Nfighting style, a .k. a.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the Eight-Impact Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.96,0:14:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It powers straight through\Nshields and armor alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We are witnessing the might of the Habusui\Narmy, forged from centuries of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Their technique is truly one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can take you down, Qin Zhao,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost as big a prize\Nas winning the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.87,0:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You brats haven't earned\Nthe right to challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.00,0:15:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Conqueror's honking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No surprise there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a legendary\Npirate worth 500 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one man I want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta thank you, Qin Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving me plenty to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like not everyone's\Nsusceptible to Qin Zhao's Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's collecting spare weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly the dark horse of\Nthe competition, Shaun the Bandit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter whose\Nreputation has earned him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the wrath of every major\Npilot across the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I have a score we need to settle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'd forget you, the man responsible\Nfor getting my partner locked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.66,0:16:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapons I retrieve are my\Nbullets, and I am the sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If that partner of yours was so important,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you prove it by\Nbreaking him out of prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like that idiot who did\Na couple of years back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the the guy's already out\Ncold—why is kelly still wailing on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,him
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a breather, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy ain't even conscious\Nanymore. That's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, in hindsight, I should have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard called me shorty. Hey, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look short to you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one bit, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if anything, you're a giant of\Na man. You hear what he said, dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's learned his lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I helped back the wrong guy again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to say that again,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll jab both your eyes out then Bobby\Ndon't you even think of slowing me down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.28,0:17:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long fight. That's the\Nultra-violent style of the Funk Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a soul in\Nthe criminal underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't know the\Nnames of these siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And based off what I'm reading, they're\Npowerful enough to take down pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,worth over a hundred million.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of squawking colors from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it if it takes all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They look like nothing but a couple\Nof two-bit street fighters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you show me what you're made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you, shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the hub of sweet\Narmies just overpowered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, how disappointing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You let everyone down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't pick sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you ready little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause you're next! Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.38,0:18:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never done this for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You will now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.58,0:18:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned his back and cowered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,These brothers are pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That broke my accent too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That blade was infused with armament Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His body is ridiculously strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that bastard had the\Nnerve to call me a shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it on for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm\Nseeing right now! Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Boo from the Cardo Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,is taking a hell of a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He is down for the count!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's not punching him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The cowardly younger brother Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or could it be the weakling\Nolder brother Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.18,0:19:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it appears to be Kelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprising, given his\Nsudden change in appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you calling a shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let that be a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.06,0:20:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, wise guy,\NI'll rip your throat out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,During this mayhem, it appears\NLucy's helmet got knocked off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give that back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I heard a very\Npeculiar tale, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A rumor about a pirate with a 400 million\Nbounty by the name of Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.66,0:20:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,who secretly entered this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don Chino Chino is cutting his way across\Nthe arena, but who's he got his sights on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure hope you're watching this, Garp,\Nbecause I'm about to kill your grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are down to the last 40 contenders\Nremaining in Block C's Battle Royale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The field has been weeded down\Nto only the strongest fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's anyone's game, but who will win?
